fixture stress_pin
doc BUILD.md s13 Testing and CI, the stress room (200 enemies, 40 procs): the first 60 ticks of tests/perf/stress_run.fixture, in the fixture suite so that the scenario stays loadable and bit-exact (docs/adr/0020).
seed 1
room perf/stress
wick ash
option votive_test_stress_taper_a 1
option votive_test_stress_taper_b 1
option votive_test_stress_taper_c 1
option kindle 1
frames 60
input
  0 R attack
  1..13 R
  14 R spell
  15..43 R
  44..55 R jump
  56..59 R
end
expect
  # The first Taper hit lands on tick 2 on three dummies at once. The gated set starts one chain per 3 ticks
  # (its Votives' internal cooldown), so it is 39 procs and not 117; the other two dummies take their hit and the
  # six procs that roll on them are inert (45 procs, 42 events). The second, on tick 6, is one hit: the burst of 39.
  at 2 procs=45 proc_events=42 proc_level=3
  never 3..5 procs>0
  at 6 procs=39 proc_events=40 proc_level=3
  # A walker on the lower tier turns back at its platform's edge (enemy 102, x 1168 u back to 1164 u)...
  at 3 enemy102.x=298496
  at 4 enemy102.x=299008
  at 19 enemy102.x=291328
  # ...and one marked fall walks off the edge and falls to the ground below (enemy 100, 640 u to 736 u).
  at 19 enemy100.y=163840
  at 25 enemy100.y=168313
  at 35 enemy100.y=188416
  # Ash, a second in.
  at 59 hearts=5 kindling=7 flame=11 enemy0.hp=163 enemy1.hp=151
end
